        right: { ja: "債権者は清算価値保証(清算より損しないこと)と経営責任・株主責任の明確化を前提に、経済合理性がある場合のみ応じる。", en: "Creditors forgive only when it is economically rational—meeting the liquidation-value floor and requiring commensurate management/shareholder sacrifice." },
