      exp: { ja: "エクイティストーリーは買い手に将来の価値創造余地を示す説得的な成長ストーリー。「株主構成の変遷と過去の増資履歴を示す年表」や「出資者の投資額と配当の実績を示す報告書」は過去の記録で、買い手に将来の価値を説く物語にならない。「経営陣の経歴と実績を紹介する採用資料」も、投資判断の根拠とは用途が違う。", en: "The equity story convinces buyers of remaining value and growth potential. A chronology of shareholder changes and past capital increases, or a report on investors' amounts and dividend history, are records of the past and do not tell buyers a story of future value. Recruiting materials introducing management's careers also serve a different purpose from supporting an investment decision." },
