      ans: 0,
      exp: { ja: "既存の深化（exploitation）と新規の探索（exploration）を両立させるのが両利きの経営。「選択と集中（コア一点集中）」は新規との両立ではなく、コアに絞る方針である。「ブルー・オーシャン（無競争市場）」は新市場を創る考え方で、既存と新規の両立を扱うものではない。", en: "Ambidexterity balances exploiting the core with exploring the new. Selection and concentration (focusing on the core alone) is a policy of narrowing to the core, not of balancing it with the new. The blue ocean (an uncontested market) is a way of creating new markets and does not address balancing existing and new businesses." },
